{
  "worlds": [
    {
      "id": "quarry",
      "order": 2,
      "name": "The Quarry",
      "stages": [
        "quarry-road",
        "cut"
      ],
      "castle": null,
      "statue": null
    }
  ],
  "quests": [
    {
      "id": "quarry.road",
      "world": "quarry",
      "title": "The road south",
      "kind": "main",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "cut",
          "objective": "Clear the rubble from the cut.",
          "completeWhen": {
            "type": "trigger",
            "trigger": "quarry.through"
          },
          "then": []
        },
        {
          "id": "river",
          "objective": "Cross the river.",
          "completeWhen": {
            "type": "trigger",
            "trigger": "quarry.far"
          },
          "then": []
        },
        {
          "id": "south",
          "objective": "Find the road south.",
          "completeWhen": {
            "type": "stage-cleared",
            "stage": "quarry-road"
          },
          "then": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "openingStage": "quarry-road",
  "openingQuests": [],
  "dialogues": [
    {
      "id": "quarry-road.intro",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "system",
          "text": "South of the Lighthouse, the Quarry.\nThe road is buried in stone."
        }
      ],
      "then": []
    },
    {
      "id": "quarry.ash",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc",
          "text": "Road's buried. Half the cut came down\nwhen the Unwriter walked through.",
          "name": "Foreman Ash"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "npc",
          "text": "We don't dig in the Quarry, child.\nWe delete. x eats the stone you stand on.",
          "name": "Foreman Ash"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "npc",
          "text": "The row slides in to fill the gap.\nSo count the rubble, then your own stone.",
          "name": "Foreman Ash"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "npc",
          "text": "Three rubble, plus yours: 4x.\nOne move, and the road's open.",
          "name": "Foreman Ash"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "npc",
          "name": "Foreman Ash",
          "text": "Cut too much? :e! puts the quarry back\nthe way it was. No shame in it."
        }
      ],
      "then": [
        {
          "type": "set-flag",
          "flag": "quarry.knows-x",
          "value": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "quarry.ash-again",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc",
          "text": "Stone doesn't forget what it's been.\nBut it moves when you tell it to.",
          "name": "Foreman Ash"
        }
      ],
      "then": []
    },
    {
      "id": "quarry.kit",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc",
          "text": "Ash says the Unwriter walked right\nthrough the cut. Didn't even stop.",
          "name": "Kit"
        }
      ],
      "then": []
    },
    {
      "id": "quarry.kit-later",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc",
          "text": "I heard the wall whisper once.\nWhat if we're already gone?",
          "name": "Kit"
        }
      ],
      "then": []
    },
    {
      "id": "quarry.note",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "scribe",
          "text": "Water won't hold you. Planks will.\nr rewrites the stone under you."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "scribe",
          "text": "A number first, and r rewrites a run:\n5r= lays five planks, yours first."
        }
      ],
      "then": [
        {
          "type": "set-flag",
          "flag": "quarry.knows-r",
          "value": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "quarry.through",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "system",
          "text": "A river. On the far bank, Blots.\nThere's a note pinned by the water."
        }
      ],
      "then": []
    },
    {
      "id": "quarry.crack",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "system",
          "text": "Through a crack: the same quarry,\nemptier. No one walks this road now."
        }
      ],
      "then": []
    },
    {
      "id": "quarry-road.death-hint",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "system",
          "text": "Count the water, plus your own stone.\n5r= lays five planks in one move."
        }
      ],
      "then": []
    },
    {
      "id": "quarry-road.end",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "system",
          "text": "The road south is open.\nSomewhere below, someone is building."
        }
      ],
      "then": []
    }
  ],
